{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368","id":5157705918,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABM2xYvg","number":368,"title":"The sulfur family is three records on three different notions of sulfur","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-15T04:48:10Z","updated_at":"2026-09-11T14:35:25Z","closed_at":"2026-09-11T14:35:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found during the adversarial review of #366. **Pre-existing — not introduced by that PR**, which merely surfaced it by recording `CHEBI:26833` as a component.\n\nMIM has three live records for what a recipe calls sulfur, on three different things:\n\n| record | identifier | what ChEBI says it is |\n|---|---|---|\n| `Sulfur` | `CHEBI:26833` | **sulfur atom** — formula `S` |\n| `Sulphur` | `CHEBI:17909` | **polysulfur** |\n| `Sulfur (powder)` | `kgmicrobe.compound:sulfur_powder` | minted in #338 |\n\n## The problem\n\n**`CHEBI:26833` is an atom, not a substance.** Its formula is a bare `S`. Nothing is weighed into a medium as sulfur atoms; what goes in is elemental sulfur, S₈ — `CHEBI:33403 elemental sulfur`. This is the same class-vs-substance error as the structureless-class work in #322, one level further down: an atom is not even a class of substances, it is a constituent of one.\n\n`Sulphur` → `CHEBI:17909 polysulfur` is closer but still a class (chains of variable length), and `Sulfur`/`Sulphur` are simply the US and UK spellings of one word, so having them on two different terms is a spelling artefact with semantic consequences.\n\n## Where it propagates\n\n`label_index.csv` publishes both spellings, so a consumer joining on either gets a different answer:\n\n    Sulfur   preferred_term  CHEBI:26833   (sulfur atom)\n    Sulfur   synonym         CHEBI:17909   (polysulfur, via Sulphur)\n    sulfur   synonym         CHEBI:26833\n\nAnd #366 recorded `CHEBI:26833:sulfur` as a component of `Yeast Extract + Sulfur`, faithfully mirroring the `Sulfur` record — so the atom now appears in a decomposition too.\n\n## Suggested resolution\n\nConsolidate onto `CHEBI:33403 elemental sulfur` for the weighable substance and merge the spelling variants, keeping `Sulphur` as a synonym. `Sulfur (powder)` was minted in #338 because its CAS was hydrogen sulfide (withdrawn there); with the family consolidated it may no longer need its own mint.\n\nWorth checking the same pattern for other elements — a quick scan for records whose ChEBI label ends in \" atom\" would show whether this is one record or a family.","closed_by":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/368/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}